  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development of the bijao and a&#xe7;a&#xed; value chains in Nari&#xf1;o</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bijao and a&#xe7;ai are two of the main pillars for future economic development and diversification in Colombia&apos;s Nari&#xf1;o, a department hampered by the ongoing and complex internal armed conflict.Through this project, 100 rural producers will be trained in sales &amp; marketing capabilities, new applications and sales channels will be explored for their products, and the connection with markets will be successfully made.</narrative>
  </description>
